  Dialogue:
  - Time: 0
    Dialogue:
    - '[s="tutorial"][auto]Welcome to Prefora! Here we''ll be teaching you the basics...'
    - '[s="tutorial"][auto]In this game, you''ll follow the prompts of your opponent
      to defeat them by matching the rhythm!'
    - '[tutorial="Hit(3)"][patterns="0"]To start, try hitting up when prompted 3
      times.'
    - '[s="tutorial"][auto]Great job!!!'
    - '[tutorial="Hit(4)"][patterns="1"]Now try it again, but this time pressing
      down...'
    - '[s="tutorial"][auto]Now you''re getting it!'
    - '[tutorial="Sequence(4)"][patterns="2,6"]Let''s get all four directions in...
      Can you get the whole patterns?'
    - '[s="tutorial"][auto]Fantastic!! When you do a whole pattern successfully,
      the enemy will lose health. If you miss a note, you''ll fail that sequence
      and lose health.'
    - '[tutorial="Sequence(4)"][patterns="3,4,5"]Try and beat a few harder sequences
      here to prove you''ve got what it takes!'
    - '[s="tutorial"][auto]Great work! Looks like you''re ready to take on the real
      thing. Good luck!'
    - '[tutorial="End(1)"]'
